Core acquisition and recording indexes for the files included in this release. raw_data_inventory lists only the 13 included pilot DAT archives. The 330 main-cohort DAT archives are omitted; original acquisition identifiers and scanner filenames in image/acquisition metadata describe provenance rather than available download paths. Main-cohort acquisition descriptors explicitly mark RawDataIncluded as false. A later version is planned to add the main DAT files after header de-identification and verified recompression. checksums.sha256 covers the current public files.
